  "shots": {
    "_comment": "other shooters: close take up to closeFullUntil, cross-fade to the distant take until distantOnlyFrom; inverse-distance roll-off from closeRef / distantRef (distantRef 14 m: the distant take, normalised to -6 dBFS, meets the close take (-3 dBFS, ref 10 m) at the same level around 40 m); air absorption low-pass fc = 20 kHz * exp(-d / airAbsorptionMeters) (>= minCutoff); propagation delay d / speedOfSound; tail gain tailRef / d (0.1..1)",
